```
Estimates under the Homogeneous Interaction Assumption:
               Estimate 95% CI Lower 95% CI Upper
ACME (treated)   0.0855       0.0541       0.1170
ACME (control)   0.0609       0.0373       0.0844
ACME (average)   0.0702       0.0510       0.0893
ADE (treated)    0.1993       0.1551       0.2436
